              "id": "3535d299-48ce-48ff-8010-d6466f032940",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Games of Life: Explorations in Ecology, Evolution and Behaviour</strong></em><strong> </strong>was written by Karl Sigmund published by Penguin, July 1, 1995."
            },
            {
              "id": "46f49590-40d7-4e58-b1cf-36575bd6ed90",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "337621cd-569a-477d-a6b7-e0c0c52ae931",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Takes an engaging journey through some of the most intriguing and fascinating areas of current biology, focusing on the application of game theory and mathematical modelling to our understanding of evolution, sex, animal behaviour and aggression.</em>"
            }
